    <!--
      Phase 5 (AudioLab + Customisation) strings, ported from Mochy Music
      (GPL-3.0): audiopass_strings.xml, mochy_strings.xml, modules_strings.xml.

      Brand rule: user-visible "Mochy" became "ChordWave" (audiopass_status_driven,
      audiopass_mode_direct_usb_desc, audiopass_mode_exclusive_dac_desc,
      audiopass_resampler, audiopass_usb_no_dac, customise_icons_caption).
      Mochy's playful typos are kept verbatim (audiopass_options "Optstions",
      audiopass_exclusive "Exclusibve stugf"), matching the Phase 4 precedent
      (audiopass_now_waiting). Strings already declared elsewhere in the
      worktree are NOT repeated here — see NEEDS.md §(a).
    -->

